.TH LLC 1 "15 October 2026" "Linux Logitech Control 0.1.0"
.SH NAME
llc \- Linux Logitech Control engineering CLI
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B llc
.I command
.RI [ arguments ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Validates and stores profiles, inventories the wired G502 HERO and G815, and queries the passive system D-Bus backend.
Hardware gate G0 is unverified. This build cannot enable remapping, macros, recording or hardware writes on physical devices.
.SH COMMANDS
Run
.B llc --help
for the complete command list. The probe is read-only. Configuration export omits serials and USB-port identity. Export refuses to overwrite an existing file.
.SH FILES
$XDG_CONFIG_HOME/linux-logitech-control/config.json or $HOME/.config/linux-logitech-control/config.json.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success; 2 invalid input; 3 authorization denied; 4 service unavailable; 5 unavailable or unverified device operation; 6 failure or conflict.
.SH SEE ALSO
systemctl(1), journalctl(1)
